#. module: om_whatsapp_website_sale
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_whatsapp_website_sale
msgid ""
"Bridge between eCommerce and the WhatsApp quotations and orders of Odoo "
"Mates: an online order confirmed by its payment is confirmed to the customer"
" by WhatsApp, and a cart left by a signed-in customer gets one WhatsApp "
"reminder with the link to resume it. Opted-out numbers are skipped."
msgstr ""

